1. **Hardcode path separators**:
// ❌ Don't do this
var path = "configs\\app.json";  // Windows only
var path = "configs/app.json";   // Unix only
// ✅ Should do this
var path = _fileSystem.Path.Combine("configs", "app.json");
Create only files needed by a test; avoid oversized simulated files, and use moderately sized data (the example generates 1,000 lines) when testing large-file processing logic.

